      [[
Reformat Lua 5.5 code.

Usage:   f_in   f_out
       ┬      ┬       ┬
       │      │       │
       └── [options] ─┘

<options>:

  --indent=<str>        Use given string as indent chunk.
  --right-margin=<int>  Right margin.

-- Martin, 2026-10
]]
